<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Command Macros <%= server.name %> | <%= settings.brandName.toUpperCase() %></title>
    <%- include('../partials/favicon') %>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body { background:#0f0f12; color:#e1e1e6; margin:0; font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif; height:100vh; overflow:hidden; }
        .wrapper{display:flex;height:100vh}.sidebar{width:260px;background:#121216;border-right:1px solid #2d2d35;overflow-y:auto}.sidebar.collapsed{margin-left:-260px}
        .content{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}.top{background:#121216;border-bottom:1px solid #2d2d35;padding:.75rem 1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem}
        .scroll{flex:1;overflow:auto;padding:1rem}.cardx{background:#121216;border:1px solid #2d2d35;border-radius:.8rem}
        .btn-icon{background:transparent;border:0;color:#8b8b9a;font-size:1.2rem}
        .form-control,.form-select{background:#0f0f12;border-color:#2d2d35;color:#e5e7eb}
        .mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,monospace}
        .macro-sequence{min-height:112px;white-space:pre-wrap}
        .macro-hint{font-size:.8rem;color:#9ca3af}
        .macro-summary{font-size:.8rem;color:#93c5fd}
        .tutorial-code{background:#0b1220;border:1px solid #24304a;border-radius:.65rem;padding:.85rem;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:.83rem}
    </style>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mobile-layout.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('../partials/error-modal') %>
<div class="wrapper">
    <nav class="sidebar" id="sidebar"><div class="p-3"><%- include('../partials/server-sidebar', { server, active: 'macros' }) %></div></nav>
    <main class="content">
        <header class="top">
            <button class="btn-icon" id="sidebarToggle"><i class="bi bi-list"></i></button>
            <h1 class="h5 mb-0">Command Macros / <span class="text-secondary"><%= server.name %></span></h1>
            <div class="ms-auto">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm" type="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#macroTutorialModal">
                    <i class="bi bi-journal-text me-1"></i>Tutorial
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>
        <section class="scroll">
            <% if (success) { %><div class="alert alert-success py-2"><%= success %></div><% } %>
            <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-danger py-2"><%= error %></div><% } %>

            <div class="cardx p-3 mb-3">
                <h2 class="h6 mb-3">Create Macro</h2>
                <form method="POST" action="/server/<%= server.containerId %>/macros" class="row g-2">
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <input class="form-control" name="name" maxlength="80" placeholder="Macro name" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3">
                        <input class="form-control" name="description" maxlength="160" placeholder="Optional description">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-2">
                        <select class="form-select" name="visibility">
                            <option value="all">All with macros</option>
                            <% if (canManageVisibility) { %>
                                <option value="owner">Owner only</option>
                                <option value="admin">Admin only</option>
                                <option value="subuser">Subusers only</option>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <option value="subuser">Subusers only</option>
                            <% } %>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-2">
                        <select class="form-select" name="runCondition">
                            <option value="always">Always run</option>
                            <option value="online">Run only if server online</option>
                            <option value="offline">Run only if server offline</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-2">
                        <input class="form-control" type="number" min="0" max="300000" name="defaultDelayMs" placeholder="Delay ms">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <input class="form-control mono" name="rollbackCommand" maxlength="1024" placeholder="Rollback command if dispatch fails">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-8">
                        <textarea class="form-control mono macro-sequence" name="sequence" placeholder="say Preparing update&#10;@delay 1500&#10;whitelist on&#10;@delay 1000&#10;stop" required></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <input type="hidden" name="command" value="">
                    <div class="col-md-12 macro-hint">
                        One step per line. Use <code>@delay 1500</code> for explicit wait steps. Default delay applies only between consecutive command steps.
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-12 macro-hint">
                        Conditions are evaluated before the flow starts. Rollback runs only if command dispatch/ack fails, not if the game/plugin command itself reports an in-server error.
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-12 macro-hint">
                        Per-step syntax: <code>@onsuccess ...</code>, <code>@onfail ...</code>, <code>@if server_empty ...</code>, <code>@if previous_succeeded ...</code>, <code>@if previous_failed ...</code>, <code>@stop_if_offline</code>.
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 d-flex justify-content-end">
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-1"></i>Create Macro</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>

            <div class="cardx p-3">
                <h2 class="h6 mb-3">Installed Macros</h2>
                <% if (!macros || macros.length === 0) { %>
                    <div class="text-secondary">No macros yet.</div>
                <% } else { %>
                    <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                        <% macros.forEach((macro) => { %>
                            <div class="border rounded p-2" style="border-color:#2d2d35 !important;background:#0f0f12;">
                                <div class="macro-summary mb-2">
                                    <i class="bi bi-diagram-3 me-1"></i><%= macro.stepCount || 0 %> step(s) • <%= macro.flowSummary || 'simple command flow' %>
                                </div>
                                <form method="POST" action="/server/<%= server.containerId %>/macros/<%= macro.id %>/update" class="row g-2 align-items-center">
                                    <div class="col-md-2">
                                        <input class="form-control form-control-sm" name="name" maxlength="80" value="<%= macro.name || '' %>" required>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-3">
                                        <input class="form-control form-control-sm" name="description" maxlength="160" value="<%= macro.description || '' %>" placeholder="Description">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-3">
                                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="visibility">
                                            <option value="all" <%= macro.visibility === 'all' ? 'selected' : '' %>>All with macros</option>
                                            <% if (canManageVisibility) { %>
                                                <option value="owner" <%= macro.visibility === 'owner' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Owner only</option>
                                                <option value="admin" <%= macro.visibility === 'admin' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Admin only</option>
                                                <option value="subuser" <%= macro.visibility === 'subuser' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Subusers only</option>
                                            <% } else { %>
                                                <option value="subuser" <%= macro.visibility === 'subuser' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Subusers only</option>
                                            <% } %>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-2">
                                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" name="runCondition">
                                            <option value="always" <%= macro.runCondition === 'always' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Always run</option>
                                            <option value="online" <%= macro.runCondition === 'online' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Only if online</option>
                                            <option value="offline" <%= macro.runCondition === 'offline' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Only if offline</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-1">
                                        <input class="form-control form-control-sm" type="number" min="0" name="position" value="<%= Number.parseInt(macro.position, 10) || 0 %>" title="Order">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-1 d-flex justify-content-end">
                                        <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm" type="submit" title="Save"><i class="bi bi-save"></i></button>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-2">
                                        <input class="form-control form-control-sm" type="number" min="0" max="300000" name="defaultDelayMs" value="<%= Number.parseInt(macro.defaultDelayMs, 10) || 0 %>" placeholder="Delay ms">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <input class="form-control form-control-sm mono" name="rollbackCommand" maxlength="1024" value="<%= macro.rollbackCommand || '' %>" placeholder="Rollback command if dispatch fails">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-12">
                                        <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm mono macro-sequence" name="sequence" placeholder="One step per line. Use @delay 1500 for waits." required><%= macro.sequenceText || macro.command || '' %></textarea>
                                    </div>
                                    <input type="hidden" name="command" value="<%= macro.command || '' %>">
                                </form>
                                <div class="d-flex gap-1 justify-content-end mt-2">
                                    <% if (canRunCommands) { %>
                                        <form method="POST" action="/server/<%= server.containerId %>/macros/<%= macro.id %>/run" class="d-inline">
                                            <button class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm" type="submit" title="Run"><i class="bi bi-play"></i></button>
                                        </form>
                                    <% } %>
                                    <form method="POST" action="/server/<%= server.containerId %>/macros/<%= macro.id %>/delete" class="d-inline" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this macro?');">
                                        <button class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" type="submit" title="Delete"><i class="bi bi-trash"></i></button>
                                    </form>
                                </div>
                                <div class="small text-secondary mt-2">
                                    Created by: <%= macro.creator && macro.creator.username ? macro.creator.username : 'unknown' %>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    </div>
                <% } %>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</div>
<div class="modal fade" id="macroTutorialModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content bg-dark text-light border-secondary">
            <div class="modal-header border-secondary">
                <h5 class="modal-title">Macro Flow Tutorial</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <p class="text-secondary mb-3">Use one step per line. The engine executes steps in order and waits for connector command acknowledgements before moving forward.</p>

                <h6>Supported syntax</h6>
                <ul class="text-secondary">
                    <li><code>say Hello</code>: normal command step</li>
                    <li><code>@delay 1500</code>: wait 1500 ms</li>
                    <li><code>@onsuccess say previous worked</code>: run only if the previous command step succeeded</li>
                    <li><code>@onfail say previous failed</code>: run only if the previous command step failed</li>
                    <li><code>@if server_empty stop</code>: run only when Minecraft status reports 0 online players</li>
                    <li><code>@if previous_succeeded save-all</code>: explicit success condition</li>
                    <li><code>@if previous_failed say rollback branch</code>: explicit failure condition</li>
                    <li><code>@if server_online say runtime ready</code>: run only if server status is online</li>
                    <li><code>@if server_offline say still offline</code>: run only if server status is offline</li>
                    <li><code>@stop_if_offline</code>: stop the remaining flow immediately if the server goes offline</li>
                </ul>

                <h6 class="mt-4">Example: maintenance flow</h6>
                <div class="tutorial-code mono">say Maintenance starts in 10 seconds
@delay 10000
@if server_empty whitelist on
@onsuccess stop
@onfail say Could not stop cleanly</div>

                <h6 class="mt-4">Example: guarded restart</h6>
                <div class="tutorial-code mono">@if server_online say Saving world
save-all
@onsuccess restart
@stop_if_offline
@if previous_failed say Restart dispatch failed</div>

                <h6 class="mt-4">Behavior notes</h6>
                <ul class="text-secondary mb-0">
                    <li>Flow-level conditions still run before the first step.</li>
                    <li>Rollback command is global and runs when a command dispatch fails.</li>
                    <li>If a command fails and the flow contains later <code>@onfail</code> or <code>@if previous_failed</code> steps, only that failure branch continues.</li>
                    <li><code>server_empty</code> relies on the Minecraft status endpoint, so it is meaningful only for Minecraft servers with a valid address.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script>document.getElementById('sidebarToggle')?.addEventListener('click',()=>document.getElementById('sidebar')?.classList.toggle('collapsed'));</script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" data-turbo-eval="false"></script>
</body>
</html>
